OL,3,GNEWSAOwner of Chihuahua found 'riddled'
OL,4,Awith fleas banned from keeping dogs for
OL,5,A10 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FA dog was found wandering the streets
OL,8,Fof his home town riddled with fleas and
OL,9,Fcovered in a yellow crust after being
OL,10,Fmistreated by his owner.
OL,12,FThe RSPCA said Snowball the chihuahua
OL,13,Fshowed signs of skin disease and fur
OL,14,Floss before he was taken to a vets by a
OL,15,Flocal warden.
OL,17,FJemma Southam, of Langlan Road in
OL,18,FLlanelli, Carmarthenshire, appeared in
OL,19,Fcourt on 13 November where she pleaded
OL,20,Fguilty to failing to provide adequate
OL,21,Fveterinary care and attention.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
