OL,3,GNEWSAOwner of Chihuahua found 'riddled'
OL,4,Awith fleas banned from keeping dogs for
OL,5,A10 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe received a 12-week jail sentence,
OL,8,Fsuspended for 12 months, as well as
OL,9,Fbeing disqualified from keeping dogs
OL,10,Ffor a decade and ordered to pay court
OL,11,Fcosts.
